6905", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031518_1113760809920238_374040494887525675_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=viVugHMMPRwQ7kNvwEOh-Ri&_nc_oc=Adovwtv2P2KUx5j8c057Gonoi2-baUaBDgsQm1fvtFDmEYzWi4JgB1HT-lphad07nTA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIp55A3YJomCmmnrkrX7mvYKTLBEKHZIeWstEfxz2jzMQ&oe=6AA401C5"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot-1.png", "id": "832532242169712", "uri": "https://scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031457_832532248836378_3663210356497322076_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=S5AYoNoB0ZQQ7kNvwES8vt6&_nc_oc=AdofdXqaYD7cIx5YIdNrGtJ4kgl8q0CjuHBh_vFkGhrmF7ZLLSmrAQbeLVHYUCX9b0U&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKAPfm7VmWWLA4uqFXNbSPsbxDiBZUKjme8H2uXZi9ppQ&oe=6AA40391"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Shotta video cover.png", "id": "998125558115830", "uri": "https://scontent-sin11-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974670_998125561449163_5721044183343334113_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=cMpeNb8618sQ7kNvwG9Gfph&_nc_oc=AdpAHftT_7AfKkoSgRabq7Ybrtpb7j6RgE-vT0qP8AyAD5yic0Wt9z_Z3PrSlNg1uPQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJB3UVRjQ7yBkRcVf4BBY0bjGMFufemUIFLygEuM9UiOA&oe=6AA421CB"}, "display_name": "No Games - Drum & Bass Music Studio", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Play incredible Drum & Bass live in multiplayer, with the sounds of UK rapper Harry Shotta and acclaimed producer Erb n Dub. \n\nMix and match hard-hitting drum sounds to generate the perfect DNB beat. Compose wicked and wild bass lines by moving the controllers around, adding hair-raising effects, all on top of Harry Shotta's classic jump-up style rap virtuosity.\n\nPlay solo or with up to 15 friends to have your own virtual DNB rave in VR!", "short_description": "Play incredible Drum & Bass live in multiplayer, with the sounds of UK rapper Harry Shotta and acclaimed produce